  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PROGRAMME ENTITLED &#x2018;REACHING THE FURTHEST BEHIND IN QUANG TRI, HOA BINH AND HA GIANG PROVINCES&#x2019;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Grant of &#x20AC;1,400,000 to Plan International Vietnam to lead a consortium of implementing partners including CARE International Vietnam and the Centre for Research on initiatives of Community Development &#x2013; RIC to implement a programme entitled &#x2018;Reaching the Furthest Behind in Quang Tri, Hoa Binh and Ha Giang Provinces&#x2019; for the period September 1st 2023 to August 31st 2024. The programme has been designed to support the furthest behind communities including ethnic minorities, vulnerable women, and people living with disabilities in six communes of Quang Tri province, four communes in Hoa Binh province, and five communes in Ha Giang province to improce their access to basic services and livelihoods and to tackle the impacts of climate change.</narrative>
  </description>
